From fc93bc8aaf2023d5a761f6be6013ba0e592d857f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt Mullins <mmullins@fb.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Dec 2018 16:42:37 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 0092/1444] UPSTREAM: bpf: support raw tracepoints in modules

Distributions build drivers as modules, including network and filesystem
drivers which export numerous tracepoints.  This enables
bpf(BPF_RAW_TRACEPOINT_OPEN) to attach to those tracepoints.

Change-Id: I2ea2898f5dedf7e70aff39c0f8ae0a5d7aa1d2af
