From df7379d4155224ac96405f2d87cc9082f2b2ea6f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Gushchin <guro@fb.com>
Date: Wed, 29 May 2019 18:03:59 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0228/1444] UPSTREAM: bpf: move memory size checks to
 bpf_map_charge_init()

Most bpf map types doing similar checks and bytes to pages
conversion during memory allocation and charging.

Let's unify these checks by moving them into bpf_map_charge_init().

Change-Id: I55ceded2303102feba9e485042e8f5169f490609
Signed-off-by: Roman Gushchin <guro@fb.com>
Acked-by: Song Liu <songliubraving@fb.com>
