From ea63de7f15d528ad3262dea3d329f5426b381737 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yan Zhai <yan@cloudflare.com>
Date: Tue, 19 Mar 2024 13:44:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0356/1444] UPSTREAM: bpf: report RCU QS in cpumap kthread

[ Upstream commit 00bf63122459e87193ee7f1bc6161c83a525569f ]

When there are heavy load, cpumap kernel threads can be busy polling
packets from redirect queues and block out RCU tasks from reaching
quiescent states. It is insufficient to just call cond_resched() in such
context. Periodically raise a consolidated RCU QS before cond_resched
fixes the problem.

Fixes: 6710e1126934 ("bpf: introduce new bpf cpu map type BPF_MAP_TYPE_CPUMAP")
