Subject: [PATCH 0533/1444] BACKPORT: bpf: Make use of probe_user_write in
 probe write helper

commit eb1b66887472eaa7342305b7890ae510dd9d1a79 upstream.

Convert the bpf_probe_write_user() helper to probe_user_write() such that
