Date: Tue, 28 Apr 2020 17:16:08 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0758/1444] BACKPORT: bpf: Add support for
 BPF_OBJ_GET_INFO_BY_FD for bpf_link

Add ability to fetch bpf_link details through BPF_OBJ_GET_INFO_BY_FD command.
Also enhance show_fdinfo to potentially include bpf_link type-specific
information (similarly to obj_info).

Also introduce enum bpf_link_type stored in bpf_link itself and expose it in
UAPI. bpf_link_tracing also now will store and return bpf_attach_type.

Also add additional missed changes from
b80e052c3ae6900f6dbcd502846650fd3a9828b7

