From ec4a72e745871302610dace696fbd0307e795e1a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christoph Hellwig <hch@lst.de>
Date: Mon, 1 Jun 2020 21:51:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 0852/1444] BACKPORT: mm: remove the pgprot argument to
 __vmalloc

The pgprot argument to __vmalloc is always PAGE_KERNEL now, so remove it.

