From e647a93d90d8f0b8771d9ba73b676f59b04c79f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kees Cook <keescook@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 19 Sep 2018 16:58:31 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1041/1444] UPSTREAM: LSM: Build ordered list of LSMs to
 initialize

This constructs an ordered list of LSMs to initialize, using a hard-coded
list of only "integrity": minor LSMs continue to have direct hook calls,
and major LSMs continue to initialize separately.

Change-Id: Ib33f232758694ce068b81481a3a17c99d5e53346
Signed-off-by: Kees Cook <keescook@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Casey Schaufler <casey@schaufler-ca.com>
---
