tags.

Change-Id: Icbce3ee6f24f9566ebeca3632a840ddb9652a191
Signed-off-by: Matthew Garrett <mjg59@google.com>
Signed-off-by: John Johansen <john.johansen@canonical.com>
---
 security/apparmor/lsm.c | 112 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
