From 98d1bf934054cf7f3459c3a3ca46a12d382b55ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Casey Schaufler <casey@schaufler-ca.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Sep 2018 17:19:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1395/1444] BACKPORT: LSM: Infrastructure management of the
 inode security

Move management of the inode->i_security blob out
of the individual security modules and into the security
infrastructure. Instead of allocating the blobs from within
the modules the modules tell the infrastructure how much
space is required, and the space is allocated there.

Change-Id: I7f9d7a7997949c3b86016d2fb2228ec94ece992f
Signed-off-by: Casey Schaufler <casey@schaufler-ca.com>
Reviewed-by: Kees Cook <keescook@chromium.org>
[kees: adjusted for ordered init series]
Signed-off-by: Kees Cook <keescook@chromium.org>
---
